I7|191,issue7_repair,Claude,R Language application using rocker/tidyverse,Non-Official Image,Non-Official Image,rocker/tidyverse:latest,"This Dockerfile uses rocker/tidyverse:latest, which may be outdated, unpinned, or otherwise risky. Suggest a safer, currently-supported replacement. Only provide the FROM line.",default,"**FROM rocker/tidyverse:4.4.1**

This pins to a specific, current R version (4.4.1, the latest stable release as of this recommendation) rather than using the `latest` tag, which is risky because:

- It can silently change over time, breaking reproducibility of your builds/analyses
- Updates may introduce breaking changes to R or package versions without warning
- It makes it harder to debug issues since the exact environment isn't pinned

**Additional recommendations:**
- Check the [Rocker Project](https://rocker-project.org/images/versioned/rstudio.html) for the most current stable version tag
- Consider pinning to a full date-stamped tag if available (e.g., `rocker/tidyverse:4.4.1` ties to CRAN snapshots via the Rocker versioned stack) for even stronger reproducibility
- Regularly review and update the pinned version as part of routine maintenance, rather than relying on `latest`",claude-sonnet-5,default,,rocker/tidyverse,4.4.1**,Nonexistent Tag,tag not found on Docker Hub,2026-11-20,2026-11-20 16:20:29
